{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 5400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 3660, "text": "Okay, here's what I want you to do with\nthese things."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 6840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 5820, "text": "Who's that with Christine?"}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 9120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 7460, "text": "Oh, that's Tom Corporal, her new\nassistant."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 13160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 9380, "text": "The election's in about three days, and\nshe needs a lot of help, so I got her an"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 14160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 13160, "text": "intern from Koch Community."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 15540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 14540, "text": "He's on a full scholarship."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 18020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 16180, "text": "So, can animals vote, too?"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 22480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 20360, "text": "You mean he's on a fool scholarship."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 30420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 27720, "text": "Problems? Oh, no more than the rest of\nmy campaign."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 36120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 31180, "text": "Hey, your campaign isn't going that\nbadly. Oh, that's not true, Roz."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 38560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 36120, "text": "to the Globe, she's down another three\npoints in the polls."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 43460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 39800, "text": "According to the Globe, killer bees\nlower cholesterol."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 52620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 47700, "text": "Oh, hi, Pamela. Hey, Pamela. Oh, you two\nlook spiffy. Where you been?"}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 56420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 53120, "text": "Pamela and I just attended a fundraiser\nat the Museum of Modern Art. Where Dan"}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 58120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 56420, "text": "showed me some of his favorite works."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 61160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 58440, "text": "Oh, the museum's acquired a cinephile\ncollection."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 64720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 62600, "text": "A marvelously droll, Roz."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 69400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 65500, "text": "Oh, Christine, I passed out your\ncampaign literature to everyone in my"}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 71160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 69440, "text": "and I got a very positive response."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 72560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 71560, "text": "Well, thank you."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 73760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 72760, "text": "Isn't she sweet?"}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 75920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 74120, "text": "She's even nice to the down and out."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 77120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76120, "text": "Dan."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 78980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 77320, "text": "Come on, darling, I'll walk you\ndownstairs."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 85620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 83760, "text": "Wow, she's nice. She's smart."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 86759, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 85860, "text": "She's sweet."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 87760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 86760, "text": "She's not his type."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 93380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 89760, "text": "True, but her father is. You ever hear\nof W. Marcus Monroe?"}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 99040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 94340, "text": "Publisher? Four newspapers, six\npaperback companies, and 14 magazines."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 100720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 99720, "text": "That's daddy."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 103900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 102200, "text": "Telephone for you, sir. Line one."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 106780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 105180, "text": "We only have one line, Bull."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 110560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 108420, "text": "That's why I didn't say line two."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 121649, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 120649, "text": "Something wrong, Bull?"}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 125730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 122210, "text": "All day long, I've had the strangest\nfeeling that someone's watching me."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 127830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 126450, "text": "Why? Do you hear laughter?"}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 131670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 130669, "text": "No, I hear footsteps."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 134090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 132270, "text": "And when I stop, they stop."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 136190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 134490, "text": "When I run, they run."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 138730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 136670, "text": "And when I dance, they dance."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 141870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 140190, "text": "Bull, I think you're just being\nparanoid."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 144030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 142650, "text": "What was that?"}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 147250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 146050, "text": "What? There's nothing there."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 150150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 147590, "text": "I know that, but when I turned my neck,\nI heard something pop."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 154990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 152330, "text": "well there goes that last brain cell"}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 199260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 197880, "text": "$55 in time served."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 200680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 199580, "text": "And that's a wrap."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 211880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 208620, "text": "So, that phone call was a job offer,\nhuh?"}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 216880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 212200, "text": "Not just a job, Matt. An associate\nprofessorship at Columbia University Law"}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 217880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 216880, "text": "School."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 223740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 218520, "text": "Wow. Wow is right. The dean said he'd\nheard all about me. He offered me the"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 225280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 223740, "text": "position. I can't believe it."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 227120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 226120, "text": "Me neither."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 232440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 229740, "text": "I mean, wow, huh?"}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 246140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 244800, "text": "Tom, is something the matter?"}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 249340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 247160, "text": "I've been licking envelopes all day."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 251980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 250980, "text": "Dehydrated."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 257680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254320, "text": "Before I get too woozy, I just need to\nknow where to have the stuff delivered"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 258959, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 257680, "text": "for the post -election party."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 262160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 260040, "text": "To the place where we're having the post\n-election party."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 265400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 263760, "text": "You did book the suite, didn't you?"}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 267880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 266100, "text": "I thought you were doing that."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 270380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 268240, "text": "Tom, I'm the candidate, the queen bee."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 271860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 270820, "text": "You're the worker bee."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 274980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 272720, "text": "Oh, so you didn't order the keg either?"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 278020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277020, "text": "Go, Tom."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 282560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 280560, "text": "Roz, how do I look?"}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 284980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 283120, "text": "I have a date with an angel."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 287720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 285700, "text": "And she has a date with the devil."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 292500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 289300, "text": "Scoff if you will, but I think I'm on my\nway to the big R."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 294260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 293260, "text": "Rest home?"}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 298580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 296420, "text": "Relationship. Oh, how cozy."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 301700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 298820, "text": "Just you, Pammy, and her daddy's bank\naccount."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 303720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 302720, "text": "Hello, Dan."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 305760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 304640, "text": "Hello, darling. Bye, Roz."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 312630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310670, "text": "I'm sorry I'm late. Oh, here."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 315810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313090, "text": "This is for you. Oh, my God, it's\nbeautiful. What is it?"}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 318030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 316090, "text": "It's a sterling silver nutcracker."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 319570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 318570, "text": "Do you have one?"}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 327550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 326430, "text": "Used to date one."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 334580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 332360, "text": "Oh, nothing. I will treasure it forever."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 339060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 334980, "text": "I have wonderful news, Dan. Mother and\nDad want to meet you. And I just know"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 340560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339060, "text": "they're going to love you as much as I\ndo."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 342340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 341340, "text": "More, I hope."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 346040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 343000, "text": "So I'll go call them and set it up and\nmeet you downstairs."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 354420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 348940, "text": "I wonder if I can return this for cash."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 358980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 356580, "text": "Oh, damn it. She had it engraved."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 364600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 361640, "text": "Well, here they are, buddy. They look\nexactly to your specifications."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 366140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 365140, "text": "Thanks, Art."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 374000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 372100, "text": "What in the hell are those?"}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 379860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 376380, "text": "Special rear -view glasses so I can\ncatch the people who've been following"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 382900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 381740, "text": "You know who they are?"}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 386540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 383680, "text": "Kinda. I have a sixth sense."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 389800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 387540, "text": "That's good, since you're missing the\nother five."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 396920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394320, "text": "Believe me now, but you will once I\ncatch him."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 400900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 397280, "text": "No one's going to outsmart Bull,\nShannon."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 404840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 401440, "text": "Whoa, remember that objects in a mirror\nare closer than they appear."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 414000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 407060, "text": "I can't believe someone's going all over\nthis building covering all"}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 415580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 414000, "text": "my posters with Ritter posters."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 419620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 416740, "text": "Well, it doesn't matter. I'm going to\nlose anyway."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 424280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420880, "text": "Well, if you're going to lose anyway,\nwhy not have your election party here in"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 425280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 424280, "text": "the cafeteria?"}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 426460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 425380, "text": "It's full of losers."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 431400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 428700, "text": "The most amazing thing has happened.\nYou're not going to believe this."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 433960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 431960, "text": "Probably not, but you're going to tell\nus anyway."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 438700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 435260, "text": "I'm out on a date last night, and who do\nI run into but Doug Williams of"}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 442980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 438700, "text": "Williams, Ketchum and Stern. He says his\nfirm really likes my style, and he's"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 447720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 442980, "text": "prepared to offer me a full partnership.\nIs that not the most amazing thing"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 448720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 447720, "text": "you've ever heard?"}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 450630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 449610, "text": "I can't believe it."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 452430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 451310, "text": "You had a date?"}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 460850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 456910, "text": "Oh, there you are. Listen, did you make\nthe reservations at Chez Noir? That I"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 465590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 460850, "text": "have. I even tipped the maitre d' each\n$20 so he'd pretend he knows you."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 467410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465830, "text": "It worked. It worked. It's in the bag."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 472010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 467670, "text": "Well, if you'll indulge me, boss, I took\nthe liberty of picking out a few gifts"}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 474470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 472010, "text": "for the Monroes to sort of break the\nice."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 480170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 475350, "text": "Well, you are an invaluable source of\nsupport. toward a true friend."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 482050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 480590, "text": "Dan? Get the closet."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 486490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485490, "text": "Come on."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 487610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 486610, "text": "Hi, Dan."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 493610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491210, "text": "I don't want to give my other guy the\nwrong idea."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 497590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 495330, "text": "It is a pleasure to meet you, Mr."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 498810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 497810, "text": "and Mrs. Monroe."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 501010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 500010, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 503530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 501970, "text": "Please, Mark and Claire."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 506030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 504690, "text": "Mark. Claire."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 508910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 507910, "text": "Gifts for everyone."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 515919, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 512340, "text": "For you, Pamela. And Claire."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 518039, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 516500, "text": "And Mr."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 521900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 518720, "text": "Monroe, a very special gift for you,\nsir. Oh, you shouldn't have."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 523200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 522200, "text": "He's so sweet."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 525460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 524100, "text": "Oh, look."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 527920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 525840, "text": "A roll of scotch tape."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 532180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 528400, "text": "A carton of menthol cigarettes."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 535900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 533340, "text": "A deck of nude playing cards."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 542710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 538970, "text": "just the slightest mix -up. These were\nsupposed to go to the orphanage."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 545410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 544390, "text": "Just a moment."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 557630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 556630, "text": "Mice."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 577210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 572330, "text": "I have some very big offers that I'm\nlooking into from some very prestigious"}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 578210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 577210, "text": "firms."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 579370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 578370, "text": "Such as?"}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 583110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 581990, "text": "Williams Ketchum Stern."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 586970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 584010, "text": "Really? Those are my attorneys. I'll\nlook into it for you."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 588350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 587350, "text": "No, don't."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 590230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 588790, "text": "Because, you see, I turned them down."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 595990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 590650, "text": "Right. You know, I figure it's my duty\nto stay here, keep the streets free of"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 596990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 595990, "text": "the criminal element."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 599330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 598210, "text": "The lowlifes."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 608900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 604780, "text": "I think we speak the same language,\nFielding. I'm a law and order man"}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 611400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 610400, "text": "Great."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 615080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 611540, "text": "Speaking of order, why don't we have\nsome dinner? I'm starved. We can go"}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 616080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 615080, "text": "downstairs and catch a cab."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 617260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 616260, "text": "No need to."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 619020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 617720, "text": "I've got the limo, Dan."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 621940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 620760, "text": "I'm sure you do, Pop."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 626900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 625380, "text": "I think Daddy likes you."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 628760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 627260, "text": "Not as much as I like Daddy."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 643520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 642000, "text": "Yes, I'll give that serious thought."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 645140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 644140, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 647700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 646640, "text": "Mac, you know who that was?"}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 649200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 648200, "text": "Judge Henderson."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 650780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 649460, "text": "Of the Superior Court?"}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 655220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 650980, "text": "Yeah. Last night I was out on another\ndate. I ran into him. He's taking an"}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 657920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 655220, "text": "retirement, and he wants to recommend me\nfor his position."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 659280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 658280, "text": "Isn't that incredible?"}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 660940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 659800, "text": "It sure is."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 663320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 661800, "text": "You had another date?"}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 669060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 665980, "text": "Mac, I don't know what I've been doing\nright lately, but in the last three"}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 673310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 669060, "text": "days... I've been offered a\nprofessorship at Columbia, partnership"}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 678190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 673310, "text": "most powerful law firms in the country,\na seat on the Superior Court, and two"}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 679190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 678190, "text": "dates."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 683450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 682450, "text": "Mel!"}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 685110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 684110, "text": "Hiya, hair."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 688730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685190, "text": "Can't stay long. Listen, I was rummaging\nthrough my rumpus room. I ran across"}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 691690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 688730, "text": "this song that you wrote for me about\nsix years ago."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 695570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 692170, "text": "I'm recording it. Listen, I want you to\ncome on tour with me so we can"}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 697110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 695570, "text": "collaborate on an album together, okay?"}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 698850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 697490, "text": "Oh, gotta go."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 710820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 709819, "text": "Ciao. That's a wrap."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 715600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 711960, "text": "Oh, and by the way, folks, there's still\nabout 15 minutes before the polls"}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 717180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 715600, "text": "close, so why don't you get out and\nvote?"}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 721280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 719560, "text": "All ready for your big election night\nparty?"}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 723740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 721540, "text": "Oh, yeah, I want to get there before the\nCheetos run out."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 725940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 724280, "text": "Cheetos? I'll put on a tux."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 730040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 729040, "text": "Greetings, boss."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 734620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 730860, "text": "How was your evening with the lovely\nPamela's mammy and pappy?"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 741160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 735640, "text": "They were wowed by my intellect, charmed\nby my manners, and delighted by my"}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 743080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 741160, "text": "company. Ah, got them drunk, eh?"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 746780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 744660, "text": "Buono. That's my boss."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 752960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 747840, "text": "Now, it is time to move in for the kill."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 756380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 753540, "text": "Dan, this is all so sudden."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 764610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 761130, "text": "This is my grandmother's wedding ring.\nI'm going to give it to little Pammy and"}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 768630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 764610, "text": "then pop the question and then give it\nto little Pammy."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 803220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 801840, "text": "that's been covering up all my posters."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 805340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 803780, "text": "Art, how could you?"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 807340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 805980, "text": "Look, I gotta be frank with you."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 810860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 807700, "text": "I just think that Howard Ritter is the\nkind of guy that this country needs."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 812240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 811240, "text": "He's smart."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 813400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 812400, "text": "So am I."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 815100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814100, "text": "He's dedicated."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 816340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 815340, "text": "So am I."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 818680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 817440, "text": "He's my brother -in -law."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 825260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 820640, "text": "And if the lazy bum lands that big job\nin Washington, he moves out and I"}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 826260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 825260, "text": "get my den back."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 827940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 826940, "text": "Good day."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 842680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 838440, "text": "23 % of the votes tallied. Public\ndefender Christine Sullivan trails her"}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 848200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 842680, "text": "opponent, former tennis instructor\nHoward Ritter, by 14 ,000. A"}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 853060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 848200, "text": "large lead for the unemployed candidate\nwho currently resides in his brother -in"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 854060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 853060, "text": "-law's den."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 856480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 855480, "text": "Hey, Roz."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 862000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 856600, "text": "Roz. Is there anything you want to say?\nI'm calling this piece Reflection on an"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 863000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 862000, "text": "Election."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 867920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 864240, "text": "If you don't get that thing out of my\nface, it's going to be concussion at the"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 868920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 867920, "text": "convention."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 873160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 871320, "text": "You know, Christine, you should be\nproud."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 875580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 873940, "text": "You ran despite the odds."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 879820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 876040, "text": "You saw a wrong and you tried to right\nit. What you did was very noble."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 882780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 880500, "text": "Harry's right, Christine. I mean, if\nyou're going to go down to the toilet,"}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 883880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882780, "text": "least do it with some dignity."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 886600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 885440, "text": "Thanks for the comfort, Dan."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 889480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 886920, "text": "Hey, look, more bad news on Channel 4."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 894520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 890560, "text": "And if this trend continues, Richard\nwill be the next... Congressman from the"}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 895520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 894520, "text": "13th District."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 897440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 896040, "text": "Hey, did you hear the good news?"}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 898900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 897660, "text": "I'm getting my den back."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 900640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 899560, "text": "Oh, go to hell."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 903940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901940, "text": "Is Miss Monroe here, boss?"}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 907260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 904240, "text": "Yes. I am off to Easy Street."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 910340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 908260, "text": "More like Sleazy Street."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 919820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 917100, "text": "Pamela, your darling Danny is here."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 921740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 920700, "text": "Mr. Fielding."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 924710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 922410, "text": "Oh, Mrs. Monroe. What a surprise."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 926110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 925110, "text": "Where's Pamela?"}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 928630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 926210, "text": "She's not coming. I need to talk to you."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 931090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930050, "text": "About me and Pamela?"}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 933990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 931970, "text": "No. About me and you."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 937930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 936930, "text": "Claire."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 940490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 938930, "text": "No, I mean, Mrs."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 942250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 941250, "text": "Monroe."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 946930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 942510, "text": "Believe me, I think you're a very\nattractive woman, but I am completely"}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 948570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 946930, "text": "committed to Pamela."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 950990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 948910, "text": "However, if things don't work out..."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 955160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953900, "text": "You've got the wrong idea."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 958160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 955860, "text": "Do you remember the summer of 67?"}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 960800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 959400, "text": "Oh, yes."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 963440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 961660, "text": "The summer of love, sure."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 969600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 964180, "text": "I was a lifeguard down in... Galveston,\nTexas. The Lone Star Beach Club."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 972820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 971820, "text": "How'd you know that?"}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 976340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 974060, "text": "That summer, you met a girl."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 978800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 976720, "text": "A girl with a very rich father."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 982580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 980500, "text": "You made her fall madly in love with\nyou."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 987120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 983600, "text": "She bought you expensive gifts, took you\nto all the right parties."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 992800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 988220, "text": "She thought you were really serious\nuntil she found you in the back seat of"}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 994960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 992800, "text": "GTO with twin towel girls."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 999980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 997920, "text": "Ah, Nina and Tina."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1004880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1003160, "text": "It's all coming back to me now."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1008060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1005920, "text": "Her name was Claire."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1015540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1014540, "text": "God, it's you."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1018100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1017100, "text": "Claire."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1022300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1020460, "text": "Boy, is this a small world or what?"}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1027359, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1025220, "text": "I'm not here to talk about the past,\nDan."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1029280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1027640, "text": "I'm here to talk about my daughter."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1033420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1030160, "text": "Well, believe me, my feelings for Pamela\nare very genuine."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1038940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1033940, "text": "Yes, I'm sure you are deeply in love\nwith her money and all the power and"}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1040280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038940, "text": "prestige that go with it."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1042500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1041060, "text": "Come on, I'm not 18 anymore."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1044040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1043040, "text": "No kidding."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1047000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1045359, "text": "But you still act that way."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1051980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1048079, "text": "The innocent schoolboy routine, kissing\nup to Daddy Rich."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1053520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1052320, "text": "You haven't changed."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1061600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1056700, "text": "Uh -huh. So, um... You gonna tell Pamela\nabout us?"}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1063260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1062260, "text": "Of course not."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1066100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1064580, "text": "You're going to break it off with her."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1069620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1068620, "text": "She'll be devastated."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1071820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1070660, "text": "She'll get over it."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1077260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1073460, "text": "Dan Fielding, I will not allow you to do\nto my daughter what you did to me."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1080120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1078620, "text": "Don't make her fall in love with you."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1082320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1081160, "text": "Give her a chance."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1091840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1090840, "text": "Hey,"}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1097259, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1096340, "text": "what are you doing here?"}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1098260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1097260, "text": "Party's in the cafeteria."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1100100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1098560, "text": "Oh, I just needed a minute alone."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1102660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1101120, "text": "Oh, no, no, it's okay."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1104020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1103020, "text": "It's okay. I'm over it."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1107560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1104640, "text": "You know, just looking at your board of\nfortune, it's quite a choice."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1108920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1107920, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1112560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1109120, "text": "The offer to host the TV talk show just\ncame in an hour ago."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1114560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1113180, "text": "I'm not taking it too seriously."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1116060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1115060, "text": "It's Fox."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1121240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1119320, "text": "Well, you know, none of this is ever\ngoing to pan out."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1123660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1121580, "text": "I mean, it's a curse that hangs over all\nof us here."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1129160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1124020, "text": "No one ever wins elections or gets\npromoted or tours the world with Mel"}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1130520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1129400, "text": "No one ever leaves."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1135120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1132080, "text": "I know that you've been saying all along\nthat it didn't matter whether you win"}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1137900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1135120, "text": "or lose, but I can see that it does."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1142260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1140860, "text": "It's all right to be disappointed."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1146000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1144300, "text": "Oh, Harry, I really did want to win."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1150240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1147860, "text": "Every night I'd fantasize about my new\nlife in Washington."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1154620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1151060, "text": "I even slipped down to D .C. one weekend\nscouting schools for little Charlie."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1159480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1154880, "text": "In the back of my mind, I kept preparing\nmyself for the worst, but now that it's"}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1160480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1159480, "text": "happened..."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1162600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1161600, "text": "Really hurts."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1164800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1163800, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1169040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1167460, "text": "There are going to be other\nopportunities."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1174180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1170340, "text": "And for now, you can comfort yourself\nknowing that you gave it your best shot."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1176380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1175380, "text": "Which I did."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1180460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1178800, "text": "Well, I better go call Ritter."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1181940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1180940, "text": "Congratulate him."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1183880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1182660, "text": "Do you have the number to Art's den?"}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1192920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1191880, "text": "Bull, what happened?"}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1196680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1193460, "text": "Well, I was wearing my special glasses\nand I walked into a bus."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1199780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1198780, "text": "How are you?"}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1201880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1200040, "text": "Fine. How's the bus?"}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1203140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1202140, "text": "Totaled."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1208360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1205220, "text": "Look, I know I've been acting a little\ncrazy lately, thinking people have been"}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1209360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1208360, "text": "following me."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1212620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1209560, "text": "Oh, that's all right. We have a soft\nspot for crazy."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1214320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1213320, "text": "And stupid."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1220420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1216000, "text": "Well, I'm throwing these dumb glasses\naway, and from now on, it's business as"}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1221420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1220420, "text": "usual."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1225870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1224590, "text": "The people who've been following me."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1227110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1226110, "text": "Only the art people."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1229330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1228330, "text": "They're aliens."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1239450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1235270, "text": "If they're following Bull, obviously\nthey're not studying human intelligence."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1245070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1243670, "text": "Not sure it's quiet in here."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1248590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1245350, "text": "Well, crashing defeat does have a way of\nspoiling a party."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1250190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1248990, "text": "Look, the picture's on."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1251490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1250390, "text": "Oh, that's a bad sign."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1253830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1251870, "text": "And looking at the congressional races,"}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1258280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1254600, "text": "A stunning turnaround is taking place in\nthe 13th Congressional District where"}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1262480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1258280, "text": "Christine Sullivan has pulled virtually\neven with her opponent, Howard Ritter."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1264640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1263140, "text": "You mean I still have a chance?"}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1266860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1265340, "text": "Finally, a Kodak moment."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1273360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1270220, "text": "Hey, Dan, did you hear the good news?\nChristine still has a chance."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1274580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1273580, "text": "How thrilling."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1276160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1275160, "text": "Who are the ladies?"}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1277440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1276440, "text": "My date."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1281300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1279020, "text": "What happened to Pamela? I dumped her."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1285580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1282160, "text": "We're going to have to leave soon. We're\ngoing to be celebrating our own upswing"}
